  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（自分でスカウトしてこい、か\r\nはづきさんも社長も、笑顔で無茶を言うよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（人通りが多いこの辺りなら……と思ったけど\r\nなかなか良さそうな子は……ん？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの子、なんだか他の子とは違う雰囲気を感じる\r\nひとりで歩いてるだけなのに不思議な風格があって……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まるで、孤高の狼みたいだな……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ねぇ君、ちょっといいかな？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと……\r\nそこの君、ちょっと待って！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ん？　アタシか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだ。\r\n君のその髪なんだけど……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ？　なんだよアンタ\r\nアタシが髪染めてんのが気に入らね－ってのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシがどうしようとアンタに関係ねぇだろ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや、そうじゃなくて\r\nむしろ、綺麗な色だなって思ってさ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なっ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。やっぱりよく似合ってるよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "は、はあ……っ！？\r\nアンタ、いきなりなんなんだよ……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、自己紹介が遅れてすまない\r\n実は俺、アイドルのプロデュ－サ－をやってるんだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、もしよかったら\r\n君をアイドルにスカウトしたくてさ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "スカウト……\r\nって、アタシをアイドルにしたいってことか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。さっき一目見てピ－ンと来て\r\n君なら絶対、すごいアイドルになれると思うんだ",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだ？\r\n俺と一緒に、アイドルを目指してみないか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "い……いやいやいや！\r\nアタシがアイドルとか、冗談だろ！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……つかテメ－。ひょっとして\r\nアタシのことからかってんじゃね－だろな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へ……？\r\nからかってるって、なんのことだ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そんなの決まってんだろ\r\nアタシがアイドルってガラに見えんのかよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "この髪に、格好だって女っぽくね－し\r\n口だってこの通り、いい方じゃね－……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "これでアイドルに向いてるって言われて\r\n信用しろって方が無理があんだろ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことない。雰囲気や喋り方は、ひとつの個性\r\nむしろアイドルとして魅力的だよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ふぅん……魅力、ね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（黙り込んでしまった……\r\n一気にたくさん話しすぎて、引かれてしまったかな）",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……西城樹里だ。樹里って呼べよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……そこまで言ったんだ\r\nアタシのことアイドルらしくしてみろよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ただし、アタシはアタシのやり方を\r\n変えるつもりはね－からな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100002/1011001010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！\r\nああ、これからよろしくな、樹里っ！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]